<metadata><name>Salmon River Road (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:150-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:trillium-lake-sno-park (OSM parking way/148019331), as 148-2; confidence: high; pdf_page: 150</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.270371" lon="-121.732742"><ele>1103.9</ele><name>Campground junction</name><desc>source: OSM junction of Trillium Lake Road and Trillium Lake Loop Road (NF 2656), as 148-2; confidence: high; pdf_page: 147</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.255703" lon="-121.751365"><ele>1084.4</ele><name>Quarry Junction</name><desc>source: OSM Trillium Lake Loop Road node where the Valhalla Trail road leaves it, as 148-2; DEM 3,558 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 150; book_elev_ft: 3560</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.247059" lon="-121.752229"><ele>1068.7</ele><name>Salmon River road junction</name><desc>source: OSM node where Forest Road 309 (way/238035234, the Salmon River road) leaves Trillium Lake Loop Road, as 148-2; confidence: high; pdf_page: 151; quote: the best direction continues on the Lower Ridge road, then branches off onto the Salmon River road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.230668" lon="-121.767269"><ele>1021.5</ele><name>Obscure road leaves Salmon River road</name><desc>source: OSM NF 309 node where the Valhalla Loop leaves for Mud Creek, as 148-2; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 152; quote: do not leave the Salmon River road and continue 1.6 miles</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.222519" lon="-121.753342"><ele>1026.6</ele><name>End of the Salmon River road (clearcuts)</name><desc>source: OSM node 2452642897, dead end of Forest Road 309 (way/1392499459); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 152; quote: continue 1.6 miles to the large clearcuts at the end of the road where there are grand views of the surrounding ridges</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Salmon River Road (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>1. Trillium Lake Sno-Park -&gt; Campground junction: osm (high), 1.33 mi | 2. Campground junction -&gt; Quarry Junction: osm (high), 1.46 mi | 3. Quarry Junction -&gt; Salmon River road junction: osm (high), 0.77 mi | 4. Salmon River road junction -&gt; Obscure road leaves Salmon River road: osm (high), 1.57 mi | 5. Obscure road leaves Salmon River road -&gt; End of the Salmon River road (clearcuts): osm (medium), 1.58 mi</desc>
